{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a clean, minimal “Author Timeline” section for illustrator Walter Ihring.
    Use a horizontal timeline on desktop and stacked cards on mobile.
    
    Each milestone should be a card with:
    – Year (big and bold)
    – Short title
    – 2–3 lines of text
    – Small image on the left or top (round or soft-cornered rectangle)
    
    Style:
    – Minimal, lots of white space
    – Soft lines, no harsh borders
    – Colours inspired by Walterin (soft yellow / cream accents, black line, subtle highlight)
    – Typography: one bold headline font for years, one simple sans-serif for text
    
    Layout rules:
    – Desktop: cards in a row with a thin vertical or horizontal line connecting the years
    – Mobile: cards stacked, line simplified to a dot before each year
    – Make sure the text stays very readable and the images stay small so they don’t overpower the text.
    
    Use these milestones: 30+ years of drawing, Playboy 2010 article, Walterin Bratislava (2015), Golden Gander award (2016), Jury invitation (2017), and the ongoing Walterin series., Create a vertical “Author Timeline” section for illustrator Walter Ihring.
    
    Layout:
    – The timeline should be vertical, with events stacked one under another.
    – A thin vertical line with dots or icons can run along the left or centre to connect the years.
    – Each event is a full-width card with generous spacing so it feels clean and easy to read.
    
    Images:
    – For each event, allow me to add 1, 2, or 3 images.
    – If I upload 1 image, display it large, on top of the text (or left/right, depending on alignment).
    – If I upload 2 or 3 images, automatically arrange them into a simple collage (e.g. 2-column grid or 1 big + 2 small), with rounded corners.
    – Images should be clearly visible but not stretched or distorted.
    
    Content fields per event:
    – Year (e.g. “2010”, “2015”, “Present”)
    – Short title (e.g. “Playboy Feature”, “Golden Gander Award”)
    – 2–3 lines of description text
    – Optional image gallery (1–3 images)
    
    Alignment & styling:
    – Give me a setting to change alignment per section (left, centre, or right aligned text) and a global option for the whole timeline.
    – Minimal, clean design with lots of white/neutral space.
    – Use a simple sans-serif font for body text; years can be larger and bolder.
    – Use very light borders or shadows around each event card so it feels soft, not boxy.
    
    Mobile behaviour:
    – On mobile, the timeline should remain vertical (stacked cards).
    – Images should automatically scale to the screen width and remain tappable.
    – The vertical line/dots can be simplified, but the order of events must stay clear.
    – Make sure text stays legible with comfortable spacing and not too small fonts.
    
    This timeline will be used to show these events: 1990s – starting out and early drawings; 2010 – Playboy feature; 2015 – Walterin Bratislava; 2016 – Golden Gander award; 2017 – Jury invitation; Present – ongoing Walterin series.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-vtimeline-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_top }}px 20px {{ block.settings.section_padding_bottom }}px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
  }

  .ai-vtimeline-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.max_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-vtimeline-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: {{ block.settings.heading_alignment }};
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.heading_spacing }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .ai-vtimeline-subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: {{ block.settings.heading_alignment }};
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.timeline_spacing }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.subheading_size }}px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .ai-vtimeline-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
  }

  .ai-vtimeline-line-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    left: {{ block.settings.line_position }}px;
    top: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    width: 2px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.line_color }};
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .ai-vtimeline-items-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .ai-vtimeline-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.event_spacing }}px;
    padding-left: {{ block.settings.content_padding_left }}px;
  }

  .ai-vtimeline-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .ai-vtimeline-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 8px;
    width: {{ block.settings.dot_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.dot_size }}px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.accent_color }};
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 3px solid {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px {{ block.settings.accent_color }};
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .ai-vtimeline-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.card_background }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    padding: {{ block.settings.card_padding }}px;
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
    box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-vtimeline-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
  }

  .ai-vtimeline-year-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.year_size }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: {{ block.settings.accent_color }};
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .ai-vtimeline-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.title_size }}px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .ai-vtimeline-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.description_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    line-height: 1.6;
    opacity: 0.85;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .ai-vtimeline-images-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin-top: 24px;
  }

  .ai-vtimeline-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    gap: {{ block.settings.image_gap }}px;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.image_border_radius }}px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ai-vtimeline-gallery-1-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }

  .ai-vtimeline-gallery-2-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  }

  .ai-vtimeline-gallery-3-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;
  }

  .ai-vtimeline-gallery-3-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-vtimeline-img-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}:first-child {
    grid-row: 1 / 3;
  }

  .ai-vtimeline-img-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.image_border_radius }}px;
    background-color: #f4f4f4;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
  }

  .ai-vtimeline-gallery-1-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-vtimeline-img-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
  }

  .ai-vtimeline-img-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }

  .ai-vtimeline-text-left-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-vtimeline-year-{{ ai_gen_id }},
  .ai-vtimeline-text-left-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-vtimeline-title-{{ ai_gen_id }},
  .ai-vtimeline-text-left-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-vtimeline-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: left;
  }

  .ai-vtimeline-text-center-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-vtimeline-year-{{ ai_gen_id }},
  .ai-vtimeline-text-center-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-vtimeline-title-{{ ai_gen_id }},
  .ai-vtimeline-text-center-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-vtimeline-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ai-vtimeline-text-right-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-vtimeline-year-{{ ai_gen_id }},
  .ai-vtimeline-text-right-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-vtimeline-title-{{ ai_gen_id }},
  .ai-vtimeline-text-right-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-vtimeline-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: right;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-vtimeline-line-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      left: 10px;
    }

    .ai-vtimeline-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding-left: 40px;
    }

    .ai-vtimeline-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      left: 4px;
      width: 12px;
      height: 12px;
    }

    .ai-vtimeline-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ block.settings.card_padding_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-vtimeline-year-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.year_size | times: 0.8 }}px;
    }

    .ai-vtimeline-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.title_size | times: 0.9 }}px;
    }

    .ai-vtimeline-gallery-3-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .ai-vtimeline-gallery-3-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-vtimeline-img-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}:first-child {
      grid-row: auto;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-vtimeline-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding-left: {{ block.settings.content_padding_left }}px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<div class="ai-vtimeline-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-vtimeline-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {% if block.settings.heading != blank %}
      <h2 class="ai-vtimeline-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.heading }}</h2>
    {% endif %}

    {% if block.settings.subheading != blank %}
      <div class="ai-vtimeline-subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.subheading }}</div>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="ai-vtimeline-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-vtimeline-line-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>

      <div class="ai-vtimeline-items-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% for i in (1..6) %}
          {% liquid
            assign year_key = 'event_' | append: i | append: '_year'
            assign title_key = 'event_' | append: i | append: '_title'
            assign description_key = 'event_' | append: i | append: '_description'
            assign image1_key = 'event_' | append: i | append: '_image_1'
            assign image2_key = 'event_' | append: i | append: '_image_2'
            assign image3_key = 'event_' | append: i | append: '_image_3'
            assign alignment_key = 'event_' | append: i | append: '_alignment'

            assign year = block.settings[year_key]
            assign title = block.settings[title_key]
            assign description = block.settings[description_key]
            assign image1 = block.settings[image1_key]
            assign image2 = block.settings[image2_key]
            assign image3 = block.settings[image3_key]
            assign alignment = block.settings[alignment_key]

            assign image_count = 0
            if image1
              assign image_count = image_count | plus: 1
            endif
            if image2
              assign image_count = image_count | plus: 1
            endif
            if image3
              assign image_count = image_count | plus: 1
            endif
          %}

          {% if year != blank or title != blank %}
            <div class="ai-vtimeline-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <div class="ai-vtimeline-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>
              <div class="ai-vtimeline-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-vtimeline-text-{{ alignment }}-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {% if year != blank %}
                  <div class="ai-vtimeline-year-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ year }}</div>
                {% endif %}

                {% if title != blank %}
                  <h3 class="ai-vtimeline-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ title }}</h3>
                {% endif %}

                {% if description != blank %}
                  <div class="ai-vtimeline-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ description }}</div>
                {% endif %}

                {% if image_count > 0 %}
                  <div class="ai-vtimeline-images-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                    <div class="ai-vtimeline-gallery-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-vtimeline-gallery-{{ image_count }}-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                      {% if image1 %}
                        <div class="ai-vtimeline-img-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                          <img
                            src="{{ image1 | image_url: width: 800 }}"
                            alt="{{ title | escape }}"
                            loading="lazy"
                            width="800"
                            height="600"
                          >
                        </div>
                      {% endif %}

                      {% if image2 %}
                        <div class="ai-vtimeline-img-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                          <img
                            src="{{ image2 | image_url: width: 800 }}"
                            alt="{{ title | escape }}"
                            loading="lazy"
                            width="800"
                            height="600"
                          >
                        </div>
                      {% endif %}

                      {% if image3 %}
                        <div class="ai-vtimeline-img-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                          <img
                            src="{{ image3 | image_url: width: 800 }}"
                            alt="{{ title | escape }}"
                            loading="lazy"
                            width="800"
                            height="600"
                          >
                        </div>
                      {% endif %}
                    </div>
                  </div>
                {% endif %}
              </div>
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

